<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9178] Partition lost event are not triggered if multiple nodes left cluster</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9178</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If multiple nodes left cluster simultaneously, left partitions are removed from GridDhtPartitionTopologyImpl#node2part without adding to leftNode2Part  in GridDhtPartitionTopologyImpl#update method.&lt;br/&gt;
Thus GridDhtPartitionTopologyImpl#detectLostPartitions can&apos;t detect lost partitions&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13176660">IGNITE-9178</key>
